  "interpretation": "v179 shows that the observation and reported geometry identify all 1,009 affine coordinates through a geometry-specific exact inverse. v180 shows that a single shared diagonal-plus-rank-16 linear map from one-adjoint features does not approximate that inverse reliably. After one unchanged CGLS step, field and gradient tails remain inside their global absolute limits, but observation p90 exceeds 0.20 under both five and nine cameras and complete cell, calibration, and frame coverage fails.",
